{
  "$comment": "GITHUB WORKFLOW YAML → THE PIPELINE MODEL (#EXP-1617; src/workflow.ts, ecode-core workflow.rs). `readWorkflow(workflow)` takes a GitHub Actions workflow ALREADY PARSED from YAML (the host parses the text) and returns {file, errors}: `file` = the `.exponential/ci.json` it reads as (pipeline.json's shape; every file here also passes pipeline.json `validate`), null when there are errors; `errors` = EVERY reason it cannot, as {path (JSON pointer INTO THE WORKFLOW), code}, sorted by path then code, each (path, code) once. A SUBSET, strict: a key not read below is `unknown_field` unless listed as ignored. TOP: `name` (no expression; sliced to the pipeline name limit), `on`, `env`, `jobs`; ignored `permissions`, `concurrency`, `run-name`. ON: a string, a list or a mapping of events: `push` {branches?, tags?, paths?} → push {branches} (when branches are given or tags are not) and tag {tags} (when tags are given: a tags-only filter never fires on branch pushes); `pull_request` {branches?, paths?, types? (ignored)} → pull_request {branches}; `workflow_dispatch` {inputs? (ignored)} → manual {}; `merge_group` → merge_train {}; any other event = `unsupported_event`; event `paths` become every job's `paths` (two events with different lists = `invalid_value`). ENV (top, job, step): scalar values become strings; `NAME: ${{ secrets.NAME }}` (the same name) makes NAME a secret of that scope (top → `secrets`, job and step → the job's `secrets`), any other expression = `expression`; names must be env names (`invalid_name`). JOBS: an id lowercased must be a job key and unique (`invalid_name`); `name` (no expression); `runs-on` (required; a string or a list; expressions = `expression`): `self-hosted` is dropped, ubuntu-*/linux → linux, macos-*/mac → mac, windows-* → windows, any other label lowercased if it is a valid label else `invalid_label`, deduplicated; `needs` (ids, lowercased); `timeout-minutes` → timeoutMin; `env`; `strategy` {matrix, fail-fast and max-parallel ignored}: matrix keys must be matrix keys (`invalid_name`), values scalar lists (`type`), `include`/`exclude` = `unknown_field`; ignored `permissions`, `concurrency`; anything else (if, container, services, outputs, environment, defaults…) = `unknown_field`. STEPS: `uses` only `actions/checkout` and `actions/cache` (any ref; `with` ignored; dropped: our runner checks the commit out, caches are a no-op) else `unsupported_action`, `uses` with `run` = `invalid_value`; a `run` step: `name` (else its first non-empty line, 64 chars), `run` where `${{ matrix.K }}` → `${MATRIX_K}`, `${{ env.NAME }}` → `${NAME}`, `${{ secrets.NAME }}` → `${NAME}` (and NAME becomes a job secret), any other expression = `expression`; `env`, `timeout-minutes`, `continue-on-error`, `working-directory`; `shell` only bash or sh; ignored `id`; `with` on a run step = `unknown_field`. The host plans one run per workflow file (`.github/workflows/*.yml`) on an ecode repository without `.exponential/ci.json`.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a typical workflow",
      "workflow": {
        "name": "CI",
        "on": {
          "push": {
            "branches": [
              "master"
            ]
          },
          "pull_request": {
            "branches": [
              "master"
            ],
            "types": [
              "opened",
              "synchronize"
            ]
          },
          "workflow_dispatch": null
        },
        "permissions": {
          "contents": "read"
        },
        "concurrency": {
          "group": "ci",
          "cancel-in-progress": true
        },
        "env": {
          "NODE_ENV": "test",
          "RETRIES": 3,
          "TOKEN": "${{ secrets.TOKEN }}"
        },
        "jobs": {
          "build": {
            "runs-on": "ubuntu-latest",
            "timeout-minutes": 20,
            "steps": [
              {
                "uses": "actions/checkout@v4",
                "with": {
                  "fetch-depth": 0
                }
              },
              {
                "uses": "actions/cache@v4",
                "with": {
                  "path": "~/.bun",
                  "key": "bun"
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "Install",
                "run": "bun install"
              },
              {
                "run": "bun run build\nbun run typecheck",
                "working-directory": "apps/web",
                "shell": "bash"
              }
            ]
          },
          "Test": {
            "name": "test",
            "runs-on": [
              "self-hosted",
              "exp-linux"
            ],
            "needs": "build",
            "strategy": {
              "fail-fast": false,
              "matrix": {
                "shard": [
                  1,
                  2
                ]
              }
            },
            "env": {
              "API_KEY": "${{ secrets.API_KEY }}",
              "CI_SHARD_TOTAL": "2"
            },
            "steps": [
              {
                "id": "t",
                "name": "Unit tests",
                "run": "bun test --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/2 --key=${{ secrets.API_KEY }} --env=${{ env.NODE_ENV }}",
                "timeout-minutes": 10,
                "continue-on-error": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "file": {
        "version": 1,
        "name": "CI",
        "on": {
          "push": {
            "branches": [
              "master"
            ]
          },
          "pull_request": {
            "branches": [
              "master"
            ]
          },
          "manual": {}
        },
        "env": {
          "NODE_ENV": "test",
          "RETRIES": "3"
        },
        "secrets": [
          "TOKEN"
        ],
        "jobs": {
          "build": {
            "runsOn": [
              "linux"
            ],
            "timeoutMin": 20,
            "steps": [
              {
                "name": "Install",
                "run": "bun install"
              },
              {
                "name": "bun run build",
                "run": "bun run build\nbun run typecheck",
                "workingDirectory": "apps/web"
              }
            ]
          },
          "test": {
            "name": "test",
            "runsOn": [
              "exp-linux"
            ],
            "needs": [
              "build"
            ],
            "env": {
              "CI_SHARD_TOTAL": "2"
            },
            "matrix": {
              "shard": [
                "1",
                "2"
              ]
            },
            "steps": [
              {
                "name": "Unit tests",
                "run": "bun test --shard=${MATRIX_SHARD}/2 --key=${API_KEY} --env=${NODE_ENV}",
                "timeoutMin": 10,
                "continueOnError": true
              }
            ],
            "secrets": [
              "API_KEY"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "errors": []
    },
    {
